# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW & BRAND IDENTITY
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

## Purpose
The personal brand and engineering portfolio for Loh Min Yu (MinYuOuO),
showcasing enterprise system architecture, civic AI applications, and
high-performance creative WebGL engineering under the crafted banner
"Lightoxy". The design language matches 2026 developer-tool benchmarks
(Linear, Raycast, and Tubik Studio).

## The 6-Zone Continuous Landing Architecture
The landing page (`index.html`) is structured into an unbroken visual journey
guided by The Architectural Guide Spine:
- Zone 0: Floating Frosted Glass Header (Lightoxy vector logo, drawer, theme coordinator, resume CTA).
- Zone 1: Fluid Hero Viewport (fluid typography bounds, Three.js 3D WebGL dual-mesh icosahedron).
- The Architectural Guide Spine: Continuous vertical progress guide connecting Zones 1 through 6 (`--scroll-progress`).
- Zone 2: Infinite Hardware-Accelerated Tech Marquee (`transform: translateX()`, 60fps, hover-pause, reduced-motion).
- Zone 3: Horizontal Expanding Accordion Deck (`min-h-[clamp(26rem,55vh,36rem)]`, `cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)`, 4 flagship cards: PRMS, Traces of Senai, JiuXi Mindscape, Colorella).
- Zone 4: Asymmetric 12-Column Bento Grid as an Interactive Engineering Skill Matrix by Stack Layer (Row 1: Backend 8-col, DevOps 4-col; Row 2: AI 5-col, Frontend 7-col) with sub-16ms dynamic inspection and CLS = 0.
- Zone 5: Secondary Showcase Gateway (ReMind, Mamak Analytics, Telco Churn) leading to `pages/archives.html`.
- Zone 6: Footer with brand attribution to Loh Min Yu (MinYuOuO) and Simone Weil anchor quote:
  "Attention is the rarest and purest form of generosity."

## Live Domain
- Canonical: https://minyu.my
- Fallback: https://minyuouo.github.io/

## Deployment
Automated GitHub Pages deployment via `.github/workflows/deploy.yml` compiling
static output directly to `dist/` with zero runtime server or database.


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# 2. TECH STACK & MODERN TOOLCHAIN
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

## Build Engine & Bundler
- Vite 8.3 Multi-Page Application (MPA) Bundler.
- Fast local development with instant Hot Module Replacement (`npm run dev`).
- Sub-400ms multi-page production compilation (`npm run build`).

## Styling Architecture
- Tailwind CSS v4 via official `@tailwindcss/vite` plugin.
- Source stylesheet: `src/style/main.css` (imported directly in HTML via `/src/style/main.css`).
- Zero standalone CLI build wrappers; no `output.css` intermediate files.
- Design tokens defined directly via CSS-first `@theme` directives.

## JavaScript & Modules
- Modular ES6+ JavaScript (`src/script/main.js`) loaded via `<script type="module">`.
- Three.js is bundled directly from local npm package (`import * as THREE from 'three'`).
- Zero reliance on external third-party CDNs (no CDNJS, no JSDelivr for scripts).
- Zero client-side hydration framework overhead (no React, Vue, or Angular runtime).

## Fonts (Self-Hosted Variable Fonts)
- Space Grotesk  → `src/assets/fonts/SpaceGrotesk-VariableFont_wght.ttf` (headings, body)
- JetBrains Mono → `src/assets/fonts/JetBrainsMono-VariableFont_wght.ttf` (code, UI, metrics)


